# Import files and the deployment scripts that embed them carry real
# household content — diagnoses, benefits files, legal matters. One was
# written into the repository root by accident and caught by `git status`
# before a `git add -A` could take it; these two lines are so that the next
# one is caught by git instead of by luck.
*.jsonl
proxmox-*.sh
